// Items. The hotbar (keys 1-9) holds shortcuts to things in your inventory;
// open the inventory with Tab.
//   title:  shown on screen
//   kind:   Tool(speeds: {material: multiplier}), Block("block name"), Torch,
//           Food(tier: 1-4, satiety: 0-100) (tiers are in food_tiers.ron),
//           Wear(slot: Head|HeadArmor|Body|BodyArmor|Legs|Feet, insulation: °C,
//                protection: {Damage: 0.2, Blood: 0.1, Injuries: 0.1}) - the share of a blow kept
//                off the bar where it lands,
//           Bag(grid: (w, h)) - worn on the back, holds a grid of that size,
//           Material - for crafting (recipes.ron)
//   mass:   kg each (default 0.5)
//   size:   cells in a grid, (width, height) (default (1, 1)); R rotates while you hold it
//   stack:  how many share one cell (defaults: blocks and materials 32, torches 16, food 8, else 1)
//   color:  icon colour (sRGB 0..1) for items without a block texture; defaults to the last model box
//   model:  boxes drawn in your hand, in hand space (metres): size, offset, colour (sRGB 0..1)
//           Block items are drawn as a small cube of the block instead.
// Breaking takes hardness (blocks.ron) / speed seconds. A missing material
// uses the bare-hand speed below; a missing entry there is 1.
